    <string name="help_item_display_modes"><b>보기 모드:</b> 격자 보기와 면보기(스프레드) 간에 전환합니다. 오른쪽에서 왼쪽으로(RTL) 및 왼쪽에서 오른쪽으로(LTR) 읽기 방향 전환을 지원합니다.</string>
    <string name="help_item_device_optimization"><b>기기 지원:</b> 스마트폰, 태블릿, 폴더블 기기 및 데스크톱(키보드 단축키 및 마우스 우클릭을 지원하는 ChromeOS 등)에 최적화되어 있습니다.</string>
    <string name="help_item_button_reference"><b>도구 모음 버튼 참조:</b><br />• <b>열기 / 저장 / 추가:</b> PDF 로드, 모든 페이지 저장, PDF 병합.<br />• <b>선택:</b> 모두 선택, 선택 취소, 선택 반전.<br />• <b>페이지 편집:</b> 회전, 이동(위/아래), 분할, 빈 페이지 삽입, 삭제 또는 선택 항목 내보내기.<br />• <b>보기 및 설정:</b> 보기 전환(격자/면보기), RTL/LTR 읽기 방향, 표지 레이아웃, 속성 및 비밀번호 보안.</string>
<string name="action_rotate_left">Rotate Left</string><string name="action_settings">Settings</string><string name="settings_options">Options</string><string name="settings_help">Help</string><string name="report_github">Report Issue on GitHub</string><string name="options_title">Thumbnail Image Size</string><string name="options_size_s">Small (S)</string><string name="options_size_m">Medium (M)</string><string name="options_size_l">Large (L)</string><string name="options_desc">Select thumbnail image size (S/M/L).</string><string name="help_title">App Guide &amp; Help</string><string name="help_overview_title">1. Overview</string><string name="help_overview_text">Mihiraki PDF Utility supports 14 languages, page reordering, spread view (RTL/LTR), deleting, rotating, splitting, margin cropping, metadata/password settings, diagnostics, and local audit logs.</string><string name="help_open_title">2. Opening &amp; Saving PDFs</string><string name="help_open_text">Tap the Open icon (or Ctrl+O) to load a PDF. Use Save (Ctrl+S) to save all pages, or Export Selected (Ctrl+E) to save selected pages.</string><string name="help_page_ops_title">3. Page Operations</string><string name="help_page_ops_text">Tap pages to select them. When pages are selected, the top toolbar buttons automatically switch from general controls (Save, Add, Settings) to page editing actions (Rotate, Move, Split, Insert Blank, Delete, Export Selected).</string><string name="help_display_title">4. Display Modes &amp; Devices</string><string name="help_display_text">Toggle between Grid and Spread views. Use Toggle RTL to switch between Right-to-Left (RTL) and Left-to-Right (LTR) reading directions (manga/books). Optimized for smartphones, tablets, and ChromeOS.</string><string name="help_settings_title">5. Settings, Diagnostics &amp; Support</string><string name="help_settings_text">From the settings menu (gear icon or support heart button), you can configure and view properties, password, options, version, help, diagnostics, and support items.</string><string name="help_item_overview" /><string name="help_item_open_save" /><string name="help_item_page_ops" /><string name="help_item_devices" /><string name="help_item_properties" /><string name="help_item_security" /><string name="help_item_options" /><string name="help_item_support" /><string name="help_item_diagnostics" /><string name="help_item_audit_logs" /><string name="help_item_report_issues" /><string name="help_purchased_items">Purchased Support Badges</string><string name="help_no_purchased_items">No support items purchased yet.</string><string name="prop_pdf_version_label">PDF Version</string><string name="version_license_title">License &amp; Open Source</string><string name="version_license_text">Distributed under the Apache License 2.0.\n\nThird-Party Software:\n• Apache PDFBox-Android (Copyright The Apache Software Foundation, Apache License 2.0)\n• AndroidX &amp; Jetpack Compose (Google LLC, Apache License 2.0)</string><string name="free_use_message">This app is completely free to use. All features, such as editing and saving PDFs, are available without restriction regardless of purchase.</string><string name="purchase_badge_shown">Support badge displayed on the version screen.</string><string name="diagnostics_endurance_title">Long-Running Stress Test</string><string name="diagnostics_endurance_desc">Select test duration and run continuous stress tests including 14-manga merge, 1100-page 9x append, editing stress, rotation, and foldable simulation.</string><string name="endurance_progress_text">Progress: Elapsed %1$d min / Target %2$d min</string><string name="endurance_iteration_text">Iteration: #%1$d</string><string name="endurance_course_text">Current Course: %1$s</string><string name="endurance_memory_text">Memory Usage: %1$d MB</string><string name="endurance_pattern_select">Test Course &amp; Pattern Selection:</string><string name="endurance_stop_test">Stop Test</string><string name="endurance_start_test">Start Test (%1$d min)</string><string name="download_all_test_files">Download All Test PDFs &amp; Samples</string><string name="cancel_download">Cancel Download</string><string name="endurance_running_banner">⚡ [Endurance Test Running] Elapsed: %1$d min / Target: %2$d min (#%3$d)</string><string name="endurance_stop_button">Stop</string><string name="processing_pdf_message">Processing &amp; merging PDF files…\nPlease wait.</string><string name="course_option_all">All Courses (Patterns 1–10)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_1">Pattern 1 (Multi-File Merge)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_2">Pattern 2 (1100p Append 9x)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_3">Pattern 3 (Merge + Editing Stress)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_4">Pattern 4 (Append + Editing Stress)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_5">Pattern 5 (Merge + Screen Rotation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_6">Pattern 6 (Append + Screen Rotation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_7">Pattern 7 (Merge + Foldable Simulation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_8">Pattern 8 (Append + Foldable Simulation)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_9">Pattern 9 (Full Combination A)</string><string name="course_option_pattern_10">Pattern 10 (Full Combination B)</string><string name="help_show_tutorial">Show Tutorial Guide</string><string name="tutorial_skip">Skip</string><string name="tutorial_next">Next</string><string name="tutorial_finish">Get Started</string><string name="tutorial_try_sample">Try Sample PDF</string><string name="tutorial_title_1">Welcome to Mihiraki PDF Utility</string><string name="tutorial_desc_1">Optimized for reading and organizing scanned books and manga with double-page spread views and RTL/LTR support across 14 languages.</string><string name="tutorial_title_2">Open &amp; Sample PDFs</string><string name="tutorial_desc_2">Tap Open (Ctrl+O) to load any PDF file, or try out the built-in sample PDF catalog right away.</string><string name="tutorial_title_3">Page Operations &amp; Editing</string><string name="tutorial_desc_3">Select pages with a tap to reorder, rotate, split spreads, insert blank pages, or delete unwanted pages easily.</string><string name="tutorial_title_4">Display Modes &amp; RTL Reading</string><string name="tutorial_desc_4">Switch between grid view and spread view instantly. Toggle right-to-left (RTL) reading mode for manga and traditional books.</string><string name="tutorial_title_5">Save &amp; Export</string><string name="tutorial_desc_5">Save all pages as a new PDF (Ctrl+S) or export selected pages only. You are all set to start!</string>    <string name="help_category_getting_started">Getting Started</string>
